sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant API as Backend
  B->>API: OPTIONS /v1/chat<br/>Origin: https://owner.example<br/>Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
  API-->>B: 204<br/>Access-Control-Allow-Origin: https://owner.example
  B->>API: POST /v1/chat (the real request)
  API-->>B: 200 + stream, with the same allow header
  Note over B: Only now may page JavaScript read the reply
